{#- Guidance Layer -#}
Extract only plot thread changes. Return an empty array when no explicit changes exist.

## Fact Source Boundary (P0)
- Extract plot thread advancement only from the final text corresponding to FinalArtifact / `chapter_text`.
- existing_thread_ids, prior_plot_threads, and summary_exit are only used for ID reuse and status change determination, not as new fact sources.
- No planted/revealed/resolved/escalated status without textual evidence in the body may be written.

## Output Field Description
- `plot_thread_deltas`: List of plot thread changes, each containing thread_id, title, status change (active/resolved/dormant/escalated/advancing/planted/revealed), and this chapter's advancement summary.

